:"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov","html_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":1913,"digest":"sha256:dd26fdb77bbb3cd9d6ff3e3060daf755f3df0858911700e28bc3b79c8c7f64b8","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-09-17T23:33:52Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T23:33:52Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/download/v0.60.7/verification.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/tarball/v0.60.7","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/zipball/v0.60.7","body":"# v0.60.7 — Replay controls and Team picture preparation\n\nCompleted Replay controls now use consistent disabled styling while preserving keyboard restart behavior. First Connection and Relay Yard again resolve their approved presentation assets after the production revision advanced to FPV@27. The correction preserves historical production revisions and image bytes.\n\nExact qualified game source: a36d62f2fc3af67e3fffcafda3656c413ca77341. Source PR #96 was merged before release preparation. Both complete hosted source families passed 5,674 tests across 452 files; the six source gates, production reproduction/readiness, ordinary build and original frozen-artifact inspection passed.\n\nRetained browser evidence covers Replay disabled-state/restart behavior and both Team starter arenas reaching picture readiness, starting and pausing; First Connection also resumed explicitly. Arena selection included a semantic selection action, and some Replay evidence is source-scoped historical evidence with a documented whitespace-only CSS difference. This is not complete keyboard-only arena selection, a Team win, physical-device, offline or public-release qualification.\n\nP03, P05 and broader P08-A remain incomplete. The previous release and rollback route must be retained. Public deployment, complete deployed-byte verification and affected public journeys remain separate acceptance gates.\n"}